OL,3,GNEWSAUnsigned acts land dream Peter
OL,4,AGabriel studio session
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor most aspiring musicians, spending
OL,7,Ffour days recording in a world-famous
OL,8,Fstudio would be out of reach.
OL,10,FBut seven unsigned acts from across the
OL,11,FWest Country have been given that
OL,12,Fopportunity after being selected from
OL,13,Fmore than 400 applicants to record at
OL,14,FPeter Gabriel's renowned Real World
OL,15,FStudios in Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
