OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAUnsigned acts land dream Peter
OL,4,AGabriel studio session
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe artists will follow in the
OL,7,Ffootsteps of acts including Harry
OL,8,FStyles, Coldplay and Amy Winehouse
OL,9,Fafter being chosen by a panel of
OL,10,Findustry experts as part of a scheme
OL,11,Ffunded through a partnership between
OL,12,FReal World and Arts Council England.
OL,14,F"It's a huge privilege," said Luca
OL,15,FWilliamson, drummer with Bristol band
OL,16,F1000 Legs. "These places are so hard to
OL,17,Faccess."
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
